0239: iOS's own restart and halt reach the hardware (PE_halt_restart was unset:
reboot(2), launchd, SpringBoard and thermalmonitord shut downs spun forever off USB).
Restart: PSCI SYSTEM_RESET to recovery. Halt: to recovery in a test boot, else
PSCI SYSTEM_OFF. BlueThermal: board thermistor readings outside 5-70 C fall back
to the battery's temperature.

